# osu! Skins for Tablet Driver

This directory contains recommended osu! skins optimized for tablet driver usage.

## Available Skins

To use any of these skins, download the `.osk` file and place it in your osu! skins folder:
- **Windows**: `%AppData%/osu!/Skins/`
- **macOS**: `~/Library/Application Support/osu!/Skins/`
- **Linux**: `~/.local/share/osu/Skins/`

